{
  "item": "Object18",
  "mu_name": "Object18",
  "mu_name_from": "Noria's object slot 17, which is the model index: every world but Lorencia runs its objects in one straight sequence, so type N is Object{N+1}.bmd and there is no friendlier name in the client than the number.",
